The '''Capitoline Hill commune district''' ({{langx|bl|Distrito comuna de Turó Capitolino}}) is one of the 5 [[Commune district|legislative districts]] in the [[Trinacria]] [[Cantons of Balisca|borough]] of the [[Castejón|Castejon Metropolis]] (121). Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the {{W|instant-runoff voting}} system.

